  "interpretation": "Real coating windows add multicomponent linear constraints (PVC band, amine-H:epoxide stoichiometric band) to the box-bounded mixture simplex. Both ratio bands linearize exactly to half-space pairs, and the constrained region's extreme-vertex set is certified by two independent published enumeration paths in exact rational arithmetic. The Snee-Marquardt caveat that honestly could NOT fire in the box-only increment now fires: the McLean-Anderson bound-only candidate set is vertex-incomplete the moment a band constraint binds, with every missing vertex lying on a band facet. Piepel 1988 CONAEV centroid identities hold exactly, and the degenerate 1:1 stoichiometry region collapses to the declared lower affine dimension.",
